74	            When they make their first payment (a wallet top-up or a server order),
75	            you&apos;re <span className="text-slate-200">both</span> credited{" "}
76	            <span className="font-semibold text-brand-300">{fmtMoney(rewardCents)}</span>{" "}
77	            automatically.
